{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54099","headline":"咏万安邑（《方舆胜览》题作《万安驿》） · 张演","name":"咏万安邑（《方舆胜览》题作《万安驿》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劲兵重作付胡奴，敺雀敺鱼计自疎。\n地入万安知几许，却怜此邑始回车。\n（见《锦绣万花谷续集》卷十一「绵州」、《方舆胜览》卷五四《绵州》）（〖1〗诗後附记云：「唐明皇幸蜀，至此而叹曰：『一安尚不可，况万安乎？\n』」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张演","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}